Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 14:55:08 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 2/5] feat(ui): implement additional inputs validation and
 state management (Task II)

- Add self.is_modified tracking for all user inputs across all tabs
- Ensure programmatic updates and initial loading do not falsely mark dialog modified
- Implement pre-save validation for Custom parameter fields using canonical keys from common.py
- Halt saving and display exact required error message if custom input is empty or whitespace
- Intercept closeEvent to prompt confirmation dialog with Discard Changes and Cancel options
- Reset is_modified to False upon successful save
